  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Menu Transparency**\n\nI\'m now focusing on making the menu transparent gray, as requested. I\'m examining the navigation bar\'s header element, specifically looking at its structure and styling to determine how best to apply this transparency. I\'m currently considering various CSS opacity techniques and potential color adjustments to achieve the desired effect.\n\n\n**Refining the Aesthetics**\n\nI\'ve decided to move away from pure transparency in favor of a semi-transparent dark gray background, specifically `bg-neutral-900/30 backdrop-blur-md`, which looks gorgeous. It makes the white text extremely legible! I\'ve also noted other options with similar effects that have an elegant \"grey transparent\" feel. I\'m focusing on ensuring it is perfectly readable. I\'m also now examining the opacity and styling of the admin button in the navigation bar.\n\n\n**Adjusting Typography Systematically**\n\nI\'m now changing the `font-mono` typography, as requested, to a sans-serif look. Rather than a global replace, I\'ve redefined the CSS variable `--font-mono` to map to \"Outfit\", which is our chosen sans-serif font. This smart move will affect all elements using `font-mono`, ensuring the font is beautifully updated everywhere. I\'ve also identified any potential hardcoded styles in text files to ensure a complete transition. I think this approach is excellent!\n\n\n**Eliminating Monospace Completely**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the user wants the monospace font completely gone. Redefining `--font-mono` to `\"Outfit\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;` is the correct approach to remove the visual representation of JetBrains Mono. Now, I\'m checking the `/src/index.css` file to see how we are bringing in the fonts and to find and correct any references to the eliminated typeface that might not be captured by the variables. I want to ensure this is eliminated everywhere.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 992120349
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
